<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending March 21 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY-------------PFT/DIV/EPS---CONSENSUS------RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>THURSDAY, March 20</p>
<p> Rugby	   F	  PFT	   62.7	 53.2-72.0    72.7</p>
<p> Group			DIV	    3.6	    n/a	  3.6</p>
<p> Guinness	F	  PFT	  954.0	940.0-968.0  876.0</p>
<p>				DIV	   16.1	16.09-17.4    14.9</p>
<p>				EPS	   33.9	 33.6-34.5    32.9</p>
<p> Courtaulds    F   **   PFT	   3.75	  1.5-6.0     36.5</p>
<p> Textiles		   DIV	   15.3	    n/a	 15.3</p>
<p>				EPS	    n/a	  1.3-8.8     25.4</p>
<p> National	F	  PFT	    58.4	55.6-60.5    41.5</p>
<p> Express		    DIV	    n/a	 11.0-11.3    10.0</p>
<p>FRIDAY, March 21</p>
<p>- No major companies reporting</p>
<p>** Courtaulds forecasts include an exceptional charge of</p>
<p>30.0-35.0 million stg</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
